        "jp": "おばけが怖いだなんて、フィーナったらお子様ねー。",
        "official_en": "Psh, only babies get scared of that kind of stuff, Fina. I didn’t take you for such a scaredy-cat.",
        "real_en": "Fina, you're such a child, being scared of ghosts!"
